    {
        "content": "<p>Fantastic, only ones remaining are</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/leanprover-community/mathlib4-nightly-testing/blob/lean-pr-testing-13492/Mathlib/LinearAlgebra/Determinant.lean#L148\"><code>LinearAlgebra/Determinant</code></a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/leanprover-community/mathlib4-nightly-testing/blob/lean-pr-testing-13492/Mathlib/Order/JordanHolder.lean#L288\"><code>Order/JordanHolder</code></a></li>\n</ul>",
