    {
        "content": "<p>On my adaption branch I have a few claude-cooked scripts:</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"Lean4\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"bp\">-</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"ss\">`add_module_set_option.py</span><span class=\"bp\">`</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"ss\">`rm_module_set_option.py</span><span class=\"bp\">`</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">File</span><span class=\"bp\">-</span><span class=\"n\">level</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">variants</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">of</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"ss\">`add_set_option.py</span><span class=\"bp\">`</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">/</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"ss\">`rm_set_option.py</span><span class=\"bp\">`</span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">they</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">insert</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">or</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">remove</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">a</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"ss\">`set_option</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">...`</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">at</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">the</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">top</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">of</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">the</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">file</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">rather</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">than</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">scoped</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">to</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">individual</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">declarations</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span>\n\n<span class=\"bp\">-</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"ss\">`fix_nonlocal_set_option.py</span><span class=\"bp\">`</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">Helper</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">that</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">bisects</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">the</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">DAG</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">to</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">find</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">the</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">upstream</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">file</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">whose</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">missing</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"ss\">`set_option</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">...`</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">is</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">causing</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">a</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">downstream</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">failure</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">—</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">useful</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">when</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">the</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">direct</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">fix</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">is</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">in</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">a</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">different</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">module</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">than</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">the</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">one</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">reporting</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">the</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">error</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span>\n\n<span class=\"bp\">-</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"ss\">`fix_unused_simp_args.py</span><span class=\"bp\">`</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">Parses</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"ss\">`lake</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">build</span><span class=\"bp\">`</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">warnings</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">of</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">the</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">form</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"ss\">`This</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">simp</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">argument</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">is</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">unused</span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">X</span><span class=\"bp\">`</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">and</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">removes</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"ss\">`X</span><span class=\"bp\">`</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"k\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">the</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">corresponding</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"ss\">`simp</span><span class=\"bp\">`/</span><span class=\"ss\">`simp</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">only</span><span class=\"bp\">`</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">call</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">For</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">`←</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">X</