        "content": "<p>I've salvaged these scripts as <a href=\"https://github.com/leanprover-community/mathlib4/pull/38602\">#38602</a>, but not given them any review.</p>\n<p>I'm generally in favour of keeping these maintenance scripts, to avoid re-inventing the wheel. We can drop them once we're in a situation where fewer <code>set_option</code>s are needed in Mathlib!</p>",
